That's highly impractical if you're not playing a pacifist: iirc, XL:8
starts at 1280xp, XL:9 at 2560. Killing a single kraken while
non-amphibious will boost you from level 8 to 9. It'd be a terrible
lot of work to limit your level to 8 in Gehennom.

I did play a few characters who drained themselves to about lvl 10
each time they reached XL:14 or so, to keep maxhp low. With sufficient
gear, high stats and maxed luck, the late and end game are definitely
doable at lvl:10-12.

The immediate problem for _very_ low-level characters in Gehennom
would be lack of skills: few levels - few skill slots. 
Hitting things shouldn't be a problem, however: with maxed luck, a +7
weapon and 18 each in St and Dx, a lvl:1 character should still be
able to have a 100% chance of hitting a disenchanter in melee.

